The '''Sika Peninsula''' was a peninsula located on the [[planet]] [[Rodia]].<ref name="BMF 58" />

{{Nature-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
In the new ''[[Star Wars]]'' [[canon]], the Sika Peninsula was introduced in the [[2016]] issue ''[[Star Wars: Build the Millennium Falcon 58]]''.<ref name="BMF 58" /> The [[Sika Peninsula/Legends|peninsula]] originated in the [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] continuity, where it was first mentioned in the [[1996]] sourcebook ''[[Shadows of the Empire Planets Guide]]''.<ref name="ShadowsEmpire">''[[Shadows of the Empire Planets Guide]]''</ref>

